# WHAT THERE IS TO HOLD.
#   item NAME KIND [key value]... | Label | what it says about itself
# Kinds: weapon (fights WEAPON of moves.world), food (heal), potion (heal, mana, effect NAME AMOUNT SECONDS), resource,
#        clothes (slot head|body|legs|feet|back, model NAME in assets/world/clothes, armour, warmth).
# Effects: speed strength stone regen flow leap.
# `job` says who gets it, in a town: the q_ names of people.law.
# What a tool can take from the world is on its weapon, in moves.world. A spell only breaks; only a tool leaves something.

item sword weapon good ore fights sword colour 190 196 210 job guard | Sword | Good for people, poor for wood.
item spear weapon good ore fights spear colour 170 150 110 job guard | Spear | Keeps them at a distance.
item axe weapon good ore fights axe colour 150 120 90 job wood | Axe | Fells trees, and it will do in a fight.
item pickaxe weapon good ore fights pickaxe colour 130 130 140 job ore | Pickaxe | Takes stone out of the ground.
item stonepick weapon good ore fights pickaxe colour 150 150 150 job stone | Quarry pick | Takes stone out of the ground.
item sickle weapon good ore fights sword colour 180 170 110 job grain | Sickle | Cuts what grows.
item staff weapon good wood fights spear colour 120 90 60 job herd | Herder's staff | For sheep, mostly.
item gaff weapon good ore fights spear colour 110 110 120 job fish | Gaff | For fish, mostly.

item bread food good grain heal 25 colour 196 150 90 job grain | Bread | Eaten at once, mends a little.
item fish food good fish heal 20 colour 150 170 190 job fish | Dried fish | Salt, and more salt.
item meat food good herd heal 35 colour 170 80 70 job herd | Roast meat | Mends more than bread.
item apple food good grain heal 10 colour 200 60 50 | Apple | Better than nothing.

item potion_heal potion good trade heal 70 colour 220 60 70 | Healing potion | Closes wounds.
item potion_mana potion good trade mana 100 colour 70 110 240 | Mana potion | The hands fill again.
item potion_speed potion good trade effect speed 0.5 30 colour 90 220 150 | Potion of haste | Half as fast again, for half a minute.
item potion_strength potion good trade effect strength 0.6 30 colour 230 150 50 | Potion of strength | Blows land harder.
item potion_stone potion good trade effect stone 80 30 colour 150 150 130 | Stoneskin potion | Much of what lands does not get through.
item potion_regen potion good trade effect regen 6 25 colour 240 120 180 | Potion of mending | Wounds close by themselves.
item potion_leap potion good trade effect leap 0.5 30 colour 170 230 240 | Potion of leaping | The ground lets you go.

item coin resource stack 9999 price 1 colour 226 190 80 | Coin | It is worth what they say it is.
item raw_meat food heal 8 price 3 good herd colour 190 70 70 | Raw meat | Better roasted.
item hide resource price 6 good herd colour 140 106 76 | Hide | Off something that ran.
item antler resource price 12 colour 214 200 170 | Antler | Off something that ran fast.
item tusk resource price 14 colour 230 226 200 | Tusk | Off something that did not run.
item fang resource price 10 colour 236 232 220 | Fang | Keep your fingers clear of the rest.
item bear_pelt resource price 40 good herd colour 90 66 46 | Bear pelt | Worth a lot, and for good reason.

item wood resource good wood colour 130 92 56 | Wood | From a tree.
item fibre resource good grain colour 120 150 70 | Fibre | Leaves and thatch.
item stone resource good stone colour 140 140 145 | Stone | Out of the ground.
item soil resource good stone colour 110 80 56 | Soil | It is only dirt.
item sand resource good stone colour 214 196 140 | Sand | It gets everywhere.
item clay resource good stone colour 170 110 80 | Clay | Soft until it is fired.
item gravel resource good stone colour 150 146 138 | Gravel | Small stones.
item charcoal resource good wood colour 50 48 50 | Charcoal | What fire leaves of wood.
item ore resource good ore colour 170 120 90 | Ore | There is metal in it.

item linen_shirt clothes good grain slot body model shirt warmth 0 colour 220 212 190 | Linen shirt | Plain and cool.
item wool_tunic clothes good herd slot body model tunic armour 3 warmth 0.5 colour 130 90 60 | Wool tunic | Warm, and it itches.
item linen_dress clothes good grain slot body model dress warmth -0.2 colour 190 150 170 | Dress | Falls to the knee.
item light_robe clothes good grain slot body model robe warmth -1 colour 230 226 210 | Light robe | For the sun.
item fur_coat clothes good herd slot body model fur_coat armour 6 warmth 1 colour 120 96 76 | Fur coat | For the cold.
item mage_robe clothes good trade slot body model mage_robe armour 2 colour 50 70 170 | Mage's robe | Blue, with a gold hem.
item cuirass clothes good ore slot body model cuirass armour 28 colour 160 166 178 job guard | Iron cuirass | It stops most of a blade.
item trousers clothes good herd slot legs model trousers armour 1 colour 90 80 70 | Trousers | Plain cloth.
item greaves clothes good ore slot legs model greaves armour 10 colour 150 156 168 job guard | Iron greaves | Heavy on the legs.
item boots clothes good herd slot feet model boots armour 2 warmth 0.3 colour 80 56 36 | Leather boots | Good for a long road.
item sandals clothes good herd slot feet model sandals warmth -0.5 colour 170 130 90 | Sandals | Good for hot ground.
item cloak clothes good herd slot back model cloak warmth 0.3 colour 150 40 46 | Cloak | It keeps the rain off.
item straw_hat clothes good grain slot head model straw_hat warmth -0.6 colour 210 186 120 job grain | Straw hat | For the fields.
item fur_hood clothes good herd slot head model fur_hood armour 1 warmth 1 colour 110 90 70 | Fur hood | For the cold.
item pack clothes slot back model pack good trade colour 130 104 70 | Pack | What a caravan carries it in.
item wizard_hat clothes good trade slot head model wizard_hat colour 52 40 132 | Pointed hat | Mostly for the look of it.
item helmet clothes good ore slot head model helmet armour 12 colour 160 166 178 job guard | Iron helmet | You hear less, and live longer.

drop wood wood
drop leaf fibre
drop ore ore
drop granite stone
drop basalt stone
drop slate stone
drop sandstone stone
drop chalk stone
drop plaster stone
drop brick stone
drop tile stone
drop soil soil
drop sand sand
drop clay clay
drop gravel gravel
drop thatch fibre
drop reed fibre
drop timber wood
drop char charcoal

# What comes off a beast that was brought down.
loot grazer raw_meat 2 hide 1
loot deer raw_meat 2 hide 1 antler 1
loot boar raw_meat 3 hide 1 tusk 1
loot wolf hide 1 fang 2
loot hunter hide 1 fang 1
loot bear raw_meat 4 bear_pelt 1

start axe 1
start pickaxe 1
start sword 1
start bread 5
start potion_heal 2
start potion_mana 1
start potion_speed 1
wear linen_shirt
wear trousers
wear boots
